  <h2 class="section-title">Future Work</h2>
  <p>The framework developed will be expanded to include new experimental data in preparation for the analysis of Europa Clipper's data. It will be also applied to Ganymede, Callisto and Titan to explore their interiors. Finally, ongoing work includes the application of this framework to the moons of Uranus in the context of the formulation of the Uranus Orbiter and Probe, highly prioritized by the Planetary Science Decadal Survey.</p>
